I have found a minor bug in nethack 3.0 pl10. Currently the code is
supposed to prevent you from being able to get more than one copy of
any particular artifact, but there are ways to get around this. I know
(and have at times gotten) more than one copy of Excalibur, Orcrist,
and Sting. You can get multiple copies of Sting by simply getting more
than one elven dagger in an inventory slot and then #naming them both
Sting. Normally, the game won't allow you to have more than one long
sword or two-handed sword in an inventory slot at any particular time;
however, you can polymorph more than one arrow/dagger/dart/etc into
multiple copies of the above. Then you can #name all the two-handed
swords Orcrist at once or #dip all the long swords into a fountain and
get multiple copies of Orcrist or Excalibur respectively.

